{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/Khazix0918/status/2109501787736813663","id":"2109501787736813663","text":"https://x.com/i/article/2109500356111872000","raw_text":{"text":"https://t.co/sI8elEQ1If","display_text_range":[0,23],"facets":[{"type":"url","indices":[0,23],"original":"https://t.co/sI8elEQ1If","replacement":"https://x.com/i/article/2109500356111872000","display":"x.com/i/article/2109…"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"Khazix0918","url":"https://x.com/Khazix0918","id":"1492195583699951620","followers":90912,"following":194,"likes":633,"media_count":164,"name":"数字生命卡兹克","description":"愿我们永远对世界保持好奇。\n公众号：数字生命卡兹克","raw_description":{"text":"愿我们永远对世界保持好奇。\n公众号：数字生命卡兹克","facets":[]},"location":"","banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1492195583699951620/1768364644","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1756592360367259648/GXJ4Kl6w_200x200.jpg","joined":"Fri Feb 11 17:55:38 +0000 2022","protected":false,"website":{"url":"https://aihot.news/","display_url":"aihot.news"},"verification":{"verified":true,"verified_at":null,"type":"individual"},"avatar_color":null},"replies":20,"retweets":5,"likes":86,"bookmarks":76,"quotes":14,"created_at":"Mon Oct 12 04:29:53 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1791779393,"possibly_sensitive":false,"views":8564,"is_note_tweet":false,"community_note":null,"lang":null,"replying_to":null,"replying_to_status":null,"article":{"created_at":"2026-10-12T04:29:53.000Z","modified_at":"2026-10-12T04:29:53.000Z","id":"2109500356111872000","title":"AI开始逆向一切，你电脑里的每个软件都要被迫开源了。","preview_text":"最近，有一个词，开始频繁出现在AI行业里。\n逆向一切。\n这个词的热度，已经到了实在没有办法忽视的程度了。\n这个故事我觉得的起点，要从最近火遍全网、大快人心的一个开源项目说起。\n事情的主角呢，叫Brandon","cover_media":{"id":"QXBpTWVkaWE6DAAFCgABHUZ0rz9b0AEKAAIUtVf6NdegBAAA","media_id":"2109501771500736513","media_info":{"__typename":"ApiImage","color_info":{"palette":[{"percentage":95.76,"rgb":{"blue":27,"green":19,"red":15}},{"percentage":2.14,"rgb":{"blue":97,"green":61,"red":33}},{"percentage":1.24,"rgb":{"blue":112,"green":103,"red":99}},{"percentage":0.44,"rgb":{"blue":59,"green":124,"red":46}},{"percentage":0.37,"rgb":{"blue":27,"green":36,"red":17}}]},"original_img_height":308,"original_img_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUZ0rz9b0AEOYEi.jpg","original_img_width":771},"media_key":"3_2109501771500736513"},"content":{"blocks":[{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"vh3t0","text":"最近，有一个词，开始频繁出现在AI行业里。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"y6sx0","text":"逆向一切。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"k6zyf","text":"这个词的热度，已经到了实在没有办法忽视的程度了。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"2q5io","text":"这个故事我觉得的起点，要从最近火遍全网、大快人心的一个开源项目说起。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"qa1ok","text":"事情的主角呢，叫Brandon Thomas，是ArtCraft项目背后的开发者。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ocgd0","text":"这个人有多年的工程开发经验，长期使用Rust，也在做面向影视创作者的AI产品。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"hlqte","text":"然后呢，他最近做了一件很搞的事，直接用Claude Opus 5.5给Adobe逆向了，用Rust重写了Adobe的软件，然后，免费开源。。。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"euqxu","text":"而这件事的起因，也非常朴素，他被Adobe的取消订阅费用恶心到了，如果在公司干设计的朋友，买过Adobe正版的就知道，他们有多恶心。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"31r0q","text":"Adobe说是按月付款，但是，你实际上是要承诺订阅一整年的套餐，也就是说，如果你要提前退订的话，就需要给Adobe交违约金。。。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ty9yl","text":"然后Thomas也被这事恶心了，给他逼急了，你恶心我是吧，行，那我也恶心你。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ds9su","text":"然后，他就用Claude，直接给Adobe逆向重写了，而且，是一口气做了7个，全部开源。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":0,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"rw2na","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"px6f5","text":"PhotoCraft、VectorCraft、FilmCraft、LightCraft、EffectCraft、DesignCraft、PrintCraft。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"01v0c","text":"对应的是谁，如果大家用过Adobe家产品的话，看名字估计都猜得出来。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":1,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"qmqbs","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"n466p","text":"Photoshop、Illustrator、Premiere Pro、Lightroom、After Effects、InDesign、Acrobat。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"rtn1n","text":"都是一些贯穿了我这么多年设计生涯的名字。。。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"m9gj4","text":"Adobe全家桶，被人一锅端了，不知道为啥，当时我看到的时候，有一种大快人心的爽感。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"yro7w","text":"当然，这些软件讲道理跟完全体的Adobe还有一些差距，不过我只能说，AI还是太神速了，几乎现在每天还在光速迭代中。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":2,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"brfl4","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"u7rwt","text":"就看看这个Issues和PR的数量，大家估计也能感受到社区的热情了。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"4x7m0","text":"不到10天，单PS的这个项目，现在已经有4万6的Star了。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"7p4mn","text":"而对于自己搞出来的这个东西，作者在Hacker News上是这么说的。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"pv3b8","text":"Software is over. But for real. I just one-shotted Photoshop. The whole thing.","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":3,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"4o7pe","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"k33sw","text":"其实讲道理，软件时代结束了，类似的话，我这半年真的已经不知道听过多少遍了。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":4,"length":14,"offset":17}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"tyl7k","text":"今年3月份的时候，我还专门写过一篇《AI，正在吞噬所有软件。》，聊过AI正在怎样改变整个软件行业。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"txxo7","text":"当时我就说过，软件正在从资产变成耗材，而现在，我们就身处这场新旧交替的洪流之中。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"sjqb0","text":"只不过，那时候我们说的还是，人人都可以构建自己的软件，那时候，Fable 5甚至都还没有上线，人类用AI创造软件，还没有像如今这么迅速。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ss569","text":"但今天，被推倒的，确是曾经的一堵墙。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"rhz9i","text":"这堵墙背后，当然有像Adobe这样口碑不是很好的公司，也有很多在过去认真做产品的公司，在做客户端、做软件的公司。发现，一夜之间，自己的护城河突然消失不见。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"dmhkq","text":"因为逆向工程，因为AI让逆向工程高效到了一个极其夸张的地步。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"q3c8q","text":"所有的软件、硬件、游戏等等，只要AI可以读到你的代码，你的产品，就已经在事实层面上是开源的了。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"wlv7y","text":"为了帮助大家理解，我觉得我还是想花一点点篇幅，讲一讲啥是逆向。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"s0u36","text":"逆向工程，Reverse Engineering。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"bhous","text":"字面意思，很好理解。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"nhmay","text":"大家肯定都知道，一个正常的软件开发过程，就是程序员编写源代码，再通过编译等步骤，最终变成电脑能够执行的程序。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"n31df","text":"如果你只有一个已经安装好的应用，没有它的源代码，想知道它内部究竟怎么工作，就需要进行逆向工程。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"czhz1","text":"这件事情过去一直非常困难。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"jtng1","text":"因为编译以后的程序，已经失去了大量原本方便人类阅读的信息。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"s07s4","text":"举个例子。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"asvbp","text":"程序员写代码的时候，可能会把一个函数命名成“计算用户余额”，然后另一个函数叫“验证支付密码”。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"z50uf","text":"这两个名字，人一看就懂是干啥的对吧，但编译了之后，可能这些就都消了，因为电脑根本不需要理解这个函数叫啥，只需要知道，哦执行到这里，哦去这个内存地址，哦进行这个运算。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"bxxg1","text":"所以，当你尝试把一个已经编译好的软件重新拆开时，看到的往往是一大坨的非常难以理解的程序逻辑。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"tq5od","text":"于是这些玩意到底对应了什么功能，那就只能靠逆向工程师自己去推断了，那整个过程其实极其的痛苦。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"k2vud","text":"那过去呢，逆向大概会有两个路线。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"8nwpe","text":"第一条就是上面Thomas逆向Adobe的路子，一般称为净室设计。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"l6mrv","text":"净室设计最经典的商业案例之一，就是1982年的康柏。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"q355j","text":"1982年的时候，那时候IBM推出个人电脑没多久，IBM这台机器有个特点，就是大部分零件都是市场上现成买得到的，唯独有一块芯片里的程序，叫BIOS，是IBM自己写的，受版权保护。谁想造一台和IBM兼容的电脑，你就卡在这块BIOS上。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"jbak1","text":"于是，一家刚成立的小公司，叫康柏，为了避免版权问题，就想了个办法，它把工程师分成两拨，一拨人去研究IBM的BIOS，只许把它的行为写成说明书，不许抄一行代码。然后另一拨人从来没见过IBM的代码，只看说明书，从零写一个新的BIOS。两拨人严格隔离，最后，干了几个月，直接造出了跟IBM几乎百分百兼容的电脑，给IBM干懵了。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"lfwz1","text":"我其实之前重构我的AIHOT的时候，也是这个思路，自己对自己进行净室设计。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":5,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"hg5f1","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"8lv24","text":"这套方法跟AI现在最擅长的工作，契合度实在太高了。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"0vk53","text":"因为对于使用者来说，根本不care你当年用了什么代码什么架构，我只想要你的功能仅此而已，甚至你原来的那些架构是一坨屎，我重写以后，性能会更强，这也是我上面重构的思路。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"u8u7w","text":"一个Agent直接暴力负责研究产品的功能，另一个Agent直接暴力把功能实现出来，你完全最后可以根据端到端的测试Agent不断比较结果，发现问题，修改代码。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"p33dn","text":"GPT-6 Astra在操作UI的能力上极强，做端到端测试极度的细心，在我过去的经验里面，它的过度防护虽然很多时候被诟病，但在做端到端测试的时候，相信我真的是无敌的强，而且是可以做超长时间的自动化的。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"qbdjh","text":"第二条就是反编译重建，暴力拆解软件内部代码，尽可能原封不动的还原。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"pxwlm","text":"比如你拿到一个游戏的安装包，或者游戏卡带里的ROM文件。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"5ed8s","text":"通过反汇编、反编译之类的技术，把里面的机器码重新转换成人类相对能够阅读的代码，再根据代码一步一步理解，这个游戏究竟是怎么运行的。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"wpxk4","text":"这个路线基本上就讲究从内部破解，原版还原，但是真的非常痛苦。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"8kqlk","text":"2019年，一群玩家把《超级马里奥64》完整地反编译了出来，就是把这张二十多年前的卡带，一点一点还原成C语言代码，而且重新编译以后，能得到和原版一模一样的游戏，这事他们干了两年。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"voae8","text":"2021年，另一群玩家用同样的办法，搞定了《塞尔达传说：时之笛》，几十个人，同样也是干了将近两年。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"xm6rg","text":"这就是过去逆向工程的价格。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":39,"offset":0,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"so4q8","text":"所以你要知道，原来很多商业软件的保护，来自于别人看不懂，也懒得花那个时间研究。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":31,"offset":0,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"av9mu","text":"或者用另一句话来说，就是别人重新实现你的软件所需要付出的成本。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":44,"offset":0,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"r9mwt","text":"因为过去逆向成本太高了，我逆向你花费的成本，甚至高于我购买你的成本，于是我没有必要逆向。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":57,"offset":0,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"trusr","text":"但是，AI来了，而且是GPT-6 Astra和Claude Opus 5.5这两种组合起来约等于天顶星科技的AI。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ehwhk","text":"于是，逆向起飞了。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"mcgo4","text":"GitHub上这两天还有一个非常值得关注的项目，热度在最近也是疯狂上涨。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"k9zcb","text":"REA，全称Reverse Engineer Anything，逆向一切。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":6,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"z3mn2","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"103kd","text":"最近的热度是这样的，一根穿云箭，已经马上10万Star了。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":7,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"1nrxe","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"3b8t4","text":"它的核心思路，就是把Ghidra、Hopper等专业逆向工具，通过MCP和命令行接口接给AI Agent。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"wcvp0","text":"Agent可以研究二进制文件，寻找相关函数，追踪调用关系，分析反编译结果。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"tpyth","text":"最后尝试把理解到的逻辑，用到自己的项目里。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":8,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"bv64x","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"xbpy0","text":"我也拿它，简单试了一下，让他去解析一下Mac上很有名的清理软件CleanMyMac。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":9,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"yqlpo","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"bg0lm","text":"垃圾清理、完整卸载、重复文件检测，恶意软件防护都给分析了一遍。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":10,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ilo47","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"eevu2","text":"然后，我又让它按照这些思路，直接开发一个原生Mac应用。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":11,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"itafs","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"6bh0f","text":"没过多久，就给我搓出来了一个雏形。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":12,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"aj6ii","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ado5k","text":"开源世界的老OG Eric S. Raymond也说，软件保密时代即将结束，几乎所有软件，都将失去保密这道护城河。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":13,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"brtyg","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"urd7i","text":"注意，这里我绝不是鼓励大家去逆向所有的产品。要知道，逆向工程本身就有复杂的法律边界，如果你未经授权，直接复制别人的受版权保护的代码，甚至把这些内容公开传播，就可能涉及侵权。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"pv8nq","text":"自己逆向进行学习，或者给自己为了省点钱，或者做一些更加定制化的产品，我支持，毕竟过去的软件真的很贵，但一定要注意边界。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"38mar","text":"当然，Adobe这种另说，虽然我知道他不道德，但我依然有一种大快人心的感觉。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"gw6s8","text":"于是，在Thomas开源Adobe、以及REA爆火之后，X上就掀起了一股逆向热潮。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"u69vw","text":"甚至已经不是逆向软件了，直接逆向硬件的协议。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"2fawv","text":"比如有人把苹果的AirDrop给搬到了Linux上，直接用普通笔记本和iPhone隔空互传文件。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":14,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"n8fh7","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"zi0km","text":"有人把家里的空调给逆向了，做了个Mac状态栏应用，以后连遥控器都不用找了。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":15,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"2difd","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"7cuf0","text":"过去，厂商可以通过不公开通信协议，限制第三方软件的接入。你想使用某个功能，往往只能通过官方提供的方式。但现在，开发者可以借助AI研究这些协议，自己开发兼容工具，甚至实现厂商原本没有提供的功能。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"5mzpd","text":"甚至，直接重写硬件底层。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":16,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"2jjcq","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"rg7sd","text":"当所有的软件的本质都将成为开源模型，越来越容易被研究、模仿和重新实现，那建立在它上面的整套商业逻辑，也将必然有所影响。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":23,"offset":0,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"8sw6l","text":"以后，凡是能装进你电脑里的东西，都约等于开源。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":24,"offset":0,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"tuux7","text":"而不想被开源的东西，就再也不会装进你的电脑里了。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"tbx1i","text":"你会看到越来越多的软件，客户端越来越薄，薄到只剩一层皮，真正干活的逻辑、模型、数据，全部锁在服务器上，必须联网，必须登录，必须订阅。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"9t5i5","text":"一个所有软件都被“开源”了的时代，我们离“拥有一个软件”这件事，反而可能越来越远了。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"mipk9","text":"这也带来了我最近一直在思考的问题。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"7dqsr","text":"就是，当所有人都能低成本复制软件以后，谁还愿意花钱做原创呢？","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"q3iil","text":"所有人都觉得，AI让软件越来越容易被复制，是一件大好事。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"22cim","text":"对于普通消费者来说，确实如此。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ux3t9","text":"以前需要花几千元购买的软件，以后可能有免费的替代品。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"k2rvp","text":"大量知识和技术，开始向普通人开放，这当然是一件特别有意义的事情。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"qx10d","text":"但问题来了。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":34,"offset":0,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"77n6f","text":"当复制一个好产品越来越便宜，创造第一个好产品的成本，应该由谁来承担？","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"2ij10","text":"因为作为一个用户体验设计师，作为一个产品经理，作为一个内容创作者，我过去所有的经历都在告诉我，原创真的很难。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"eys51","text":"你需要判断用户究竟需要什么，需要探索正确的产品形态，需要经历大量失败，还要承担市场不接受你的风险。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"v7ovy","text":"我们终于创造了一个市场买账的产品，可对不起，这是AI时代了。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"xg0jn","text":"创造这些成果的人，能够独享收益的时间，却可能越来越短。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"z7qug","text":"可能只需要3天，你的开源版本，就已经满天飞了。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"gfz2r","text":"那怎么办呢？我不知道。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"a4bzj","text":"3年前，那时候我做了很多年的产品，至今我最喜欢的事、我的梦想还是做产品，但是那时候，我对AI时代的产品未来感受到了深深的绝望，所以我选择做IP，把自己打造成一个无法被复制的产品。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"2how3","text":"3年后的今天，我感受到的，却是更深的绝望。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"tue93","text":"我几乎开源了我的一切，因为我真的不觉得产品、方法论等等，在这个时代，还有任何的护城河可言，那不如早一点开源出去吧，还能对世界做做贡献，还有人可能还会记得我。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"qwy77","text":"所以，如果你现在问我，你觉得这个时代，还有什么东西能构成护城河呢。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"rnpoz","text":"我可能，只能说出那个唯一的答案：","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"aagkz","text":"注意力。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"d2drs","text":"你能获得多少这个世界长期、正向、有价值的注意力，你就是能垒起多高的护城河。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ej8ku","text":"《Attention Is All You Need》","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"xsgg9","text":"答案。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"femg7","text":"其实已经藏在9年前的这个标题里了。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":45,"offset":0,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"43van","text":"以上，既然看到这里了，如果觉得不错，随手点个赞、评论、转发三连吧，这对我们有特别大的帮助~","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":17,"offset":0,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"827u1","text":"谢谢你看我的文章，我们，下次再见。","type":"unstyled"}],"entityMap":[{"key":"12","value":{"data":{"entityKey":"fb1cf213-5598-4059-aa40-211c4628280b","mediaItems":[{"localMediaId":"12","mediaCategory":"DraftTweetImage","mediaId":"2109500315183849472"}]},"mutability":"Immutable","type":"MEDIA"}},{"key":"8","value":{"data":{"entityKey":"be7d88c1-e860-4ffd-a0b3-050070420e1a","tweetId":"2108245653843509415"},"mutability":"Immutable","type":"TWEET"}},{"key":"4","value":{"data":{"entityKey":"c9a4827f-1b40-4a3a-aab7-aaeec997104e","url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIyMzA5NjEyMA==&mid=2647680642&idx=1&sn=5fa4079a7173030c78cf9a4b2a60f35f&scene=21#wechat_redirect"},"mutability":"Mutable","type":"LINK"}},{"key":"15","value":{"data":{"tweetId":"2109031477484937571"},"mutability":"Immutable","type":"TWEET"}},{"key":"11","value":{"data":{"entityKey":"263a3a46-71ab-40fc-b464-a8a758cb7c61","mediaItems":[{"localMediaId":"11","mediaCategory":"DraftTweetImage","mediaId":"2109500304945471488"}]},"mutability":"Immutable","type":"MEDIA"}},{"key":"9","value":{"data":{"entityKey":"4c08f489-e3aa-4c8b-82f8-1493423acc31","mediaItems":[{"localMediaId":"9","mediaCategory":"DraftTweetImage","mediaId":"2109500291616047104"}]},"mutability":"Immutable","type":"MEDIA"}},{"key":"13","value":{"data":{"entityKey":"5a781eb3-eccd-4dc9-ab0c-8119734a7e38","mediaItems":[{"localMediaId":"13","mediaCategory":"DraftTweetImage","mediaId":"2109500324490960896"}]},"mutability":"Immutable","type":"MEDIA"}},{"key":"16","value":{"data":{"tweetId":"2105936290973876379"},"mutability":"Immutable","type":"TWEET"}},{"key":"5","value":{"data":{"entityKey":"2daffcf1-d0a4-445b-8922-57800af87049","tweetId":"2104129415433363628"},"mutability":"Immutable","type":"TWEET"}},{"key":"10","value":{"data":{"entityKey":"d0f18373-146